  Proof.
    induction n as [|n IH]; intros Q i bl1 bc1 x1 x5 x6 x7 x10 x16 x17 x24 x25 x28 x29 x30 x31 F msF mo m s
      Hn VIS KR Hi Hbc Hb0 Hb8 Hbh Hba WR AD MI K; [lia|].
    pose proof (gz_of_addressable8 m bl1 bc1 AD ltac:(lia)) as GZ.
    remember (mkR x1 (Z_to_bv 64 (spz - 96)) gp tp x5 x6 x7 (rO o1 16) (Z_to_bv 64 o1) x10
                  (Z_to_bv 64 bc1) (Z_to_bv 64 bl1) (Z_to_bv 64 (8 * i)) (Z_to_bv 64 i) (Z_to_bv 64 (2 ^ 64 - 1 - bl1)) x16 x17
                  (rO o1 8) (Z_to_bv 64 o2) (rO o1 24) (Z_to_bv 64 SHBASE) (rSh (rO o1 24)) (rSrl o1)
                  x24 x25 s10 s11 x28 x29 x30 x31) as R eqn:HR0.
    pose (E := Eseed R [Z_to_bv 64 bl1; Z_to_bv 64 (8 * i); Z_to_bv 64 i; Z_to_bv 64 bc1; Z_to_bv 64 (2 ^ 64 - 1 - bl1)]).
